  "body": "There is no MCP tool that edits an existing document tool; only add_tool. Add edit_tool over ChangeTool (JSON merge patch over the tool shape get_job shows, null clears an optional field), including the #898 catalog keys part_number, vendor, coating, helix_deg, notes. One undo step.\n\nPart of #898 (catalog fields ship via add_tool's definition only).\n\nDone means: edit_tool patches a tool through ChangeTool, refuses by tool name, undoable; pinned.",
